      {
        "id": 146603,
        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-09T19:00:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Experiment221\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/experiment221/48/2180_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Experiment221:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>So is that death of Ra relating to him becoming the Horus of two horizons or the death of Blake into a new Ra for tatics?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>The latter. Ra did the Horus thing way before he faced off against Oblivaeon along side the Ennead and was killed.</p>\n<p>Because Blake died, when Ra returned in Tactics, it was because the avatar of Ra choose a new host.</p>",
