        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ronway\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/48/1856_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ronway:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>When you do tell him that Ra dies, be sure to include that Ra was the first person to hurt the big bad that no one thought could be hurt. Surely that would make him pretty happy.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It made me happy.</p>\n<p>Course, I still want a heroic Ennead deck so I can at least play out that fateful (and fatal) charge.</p>",
